{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25996","headline":"客途逢乡人旋别 · 鲍溶","name":"客途逢乡人旋别","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"惊鸿一断行，天远会无因。\n无因忽相会，感叹若有神。\n我乡路三千，百里一主人。\n一宿独何恋，何况旧乡邻。\n牢落岁华晏，相怜客中贫。\n迎霜君衣煖，与我同一身。\n谁在天日下，此生能不勤。\n青萍寄流水，安得长相亲。\n明发更远道，山河重苦辛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25996.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25996","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}